  "ingredients": [
    "1 9-inch unbaked pie crust",
    "4 eggs",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "2 cups milk",
    "1 pinch ground nutmeg, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/StTG_PUTeIJM_yEysH6NhITbe9Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-263342-Homemade-Baked-Egg-Custard-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-96a5aa3f6570439eab1bb6d155338a68.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263342/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place pastry into a 9-inch pie plate so it covers the bottom and the sides. Crimp edge, if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Fh25uqvsvq9zGhlkb9KL9nuHUpg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-263342-Homemade-Baked-Egg-Custard-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-c67a621b0d7d4df68853c19a71495017.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263342/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line the bottom of pastry with foil or parchment and fill with dried beans or pie weights. Bake in the preheated oven for 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M73ctEvHsdwD3Ua6fETtddoUGXk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-263342-Homemade-Baked-Egg-Custard-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-0c8b69f08c074c279a3f18d24be8da60.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263342/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove lining and beans or weights; continue baking until crust is set and dry, about 5 minutes. Reduce oven temperature to 350 degrees F. Let pastry cool about 10 minutes while preparing filling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/K4Z3xyv2KVvsCa1aO7dnOpGCaXM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-263342-Homemade-Baked-Egg-Custard-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-f74d716adf3040a3b82d8330d0008860.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263342/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make egg custard filling: Beat eggs and sugar in a bowl with an electric mixer until combined. Beat in vanilla. Gradually stir in milk until fully incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H-j6U89hgkkM3OC4VNzNLvtEGvM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-263342-Homemade-Baked-Egg-Custard-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-7064ae5fcb3e43fa8b9d42b95583f70a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263342/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour custard mixture over partially baked crust. Note that the crust will be full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/A52bKbfH_NwqBndcYJpC-yjp_iY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-263342-Homemade-Baked-Egg-Custard-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-cf33511040084d18ba7c137ec6e35116.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263342/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle nutmeg over the filling. Bake in the preheated oven until custard is set and a sharp knife inserted near the center comes out clean, about 40 minutes. Cover edge of pastry with foil for the last 15 minutes of baking to prevent overbrowning.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LnsZ5fvTv-_aEY4Bn6z3kC28MbQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-263342-Homemade-Baked-Egg-Custard-ddmfs-4x3-step-08-e40bde9895c5455a8833646d72903db4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263342/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool completely before serving, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EhZS63BkHfJVD3TwXeisbUiTpAI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-263342-Homemade-Baked-Egg-Custard-ddmfs-beauty-4x3-4dff7d40c6024b0080c5e6186db3db1b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/263342/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
